===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|hi|en}} ([[w:Hindustani language|Hindustani]]), from {{etyl|ar|en}} {{m|ar|سَائِس||stableman, groom}}, from {{m|ar|سَاس||to tend a horse}}.

